1
00:00:05,640 --> 00:00:06,440
Brother.

2
00:00:06,880 --> 00:00:07,680
Why can its wing bones,

3
00:00:07,680 --> 00:00:09,160
armor, and tail stingers

4
00:00:09,400 --> 00:00:11,080
shift positions together

5
00:00:11,080 --> 00:00:12,480
in different movements?

6
00:00:14,440 --> 00:00:17,120
It's not turning it into three different things.

7
00:00:17,120 --> 00:00:19,440
The movable pins shifting along the dovetail grooves

8
00:00:19,440 --> 00:00:20,970
just help its original body

9
00:00:21,080 --> 00:00:22,880
complete different movements.

10
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:25,280
Dovetail grooves and movable pins.

11
00:00:25,280 --> 00:00:26,640
No wonder it won't get stuck.

12
00:00:26,640 --> 00:00:27,840
You didn't think of it

13
00:00:27,880 --> 00:00:29,720
because you've always treated it as a mechanism.

14
00:00:29,720 --> 00:00:32,320
You think it's an object that can be disassembled.

15
00:00:32,320 --> 00:00:33,980
But it's a living thing first,

16
00:00:34,160 --> 00:00:35,360
and a mechanism last.

17
00:00:35,720 --> 00:00:36,480
Then tell me,

18
00:00:36,720 --> 00:00:38,240
where did the Tang family's approach go wrong?

19
00:00:38,240 --> 00:00:40,000
When the Tang family makes giant mechanisms,

20
00:00:40,000 --> 00:00:40,960
they prioritize stability.

21
00:00:40,960 --> 00:00:42,520
The Wooden Armor Guard is a living creature first.

22
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:44,920
All structures must follow its bones, muscles, and habits.

23
00:00:44,920 --> 00:00:46,000
But when you designed it,

24
00:00:46,000 --> 00:00:47,520
you thought about making it complete the movement,

25
00:00:47,520 --> 00:00:49,280
rather than letting it do the movement alive.

26
00:00:49,280 --> 00:00:49,720
Senior Brother,

27
00:00:49,720 --> 00:00:51,180
let me be your apprentice.

28
00:00:51,880 --> 00:00:53,240
The heir to the Tang family's mechanism arts,

29
00:00:53,240 --> 00:00:54,440
being my apprentice?

30
00:00:54,760 --> 00:00:55,760
You don't want to?

31
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:07,760
Xiaotang is completely healed.

32
00:01:07,880 --> 00:01:10,720
The doctors at Jisheng Clinic all say it's incredible.

33
00:01:10,720 --> 00:01:11,360
Qinghe,

34
00:01:11,800 --> 00:01:13,130
thanks to you this time.

35
00:01:13,360 --> 00:01:14,880
You're welcome, Uncle Tang.

36
00:01:14,880 --> 00:01:16,080
It's what I should do.

37
00:01:21,680 --> 00:01:22,920
This is the letter your master

38
00:01:22,920 --> 00:01:25,160
left for you ten years ago.

39
00:01:32,800 --> 00:01:33,200
Kan.

40
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:34,680
The sect's Eight Trigrams copper coins.

41
00:01:34,680 --> 00:01:34,800
Kan.

42
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,860
I have hidden them in various places.

43
00:01:37,080 --> 00:01:39,000
Mo Wenshan only knows the Li trigram.

44
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:40,160
The other seven trigrams

45
00:01:40,160 --> 00:01:44,160
must be found one by one from the suppressing objects in various places.

46
00:01:52,479 --> 00:01:53,960
Every time you break a suppressing object,

47
00:01:53,960 --> 00:01:55,479
you get a trigram coin.

48
00:01:56,120 --> 00:01:58,920
Master intentionally wanted me to follow these setups to find them.

49
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:01,120
Xuanchen never explains things fully.

50
00:02:01,160 --> 00:02:03,290
He wants you to go through it yourself.

51
00:02:03,440 --> 00:02:04,700
There must be a reason.

52
00:02:06,280 --> 00:02:07,280
I'll go to Su City.

53
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:09,810
Master lived there for a while before.

54
00:02:10,280 --> 00:02:11,880
Just ask if you need anything.

55
00:02:11,880 --> 00:02:14,610
But Xiaotang will definitely want to go with you.

56
00:02:19,240 --> 00:02:19,880
Qinqiang.

57
00:02:20,200 --> 00:02:22,130
I've never actually heard it live.

58
00:02:22,280 --> 00:02:24,140
My teacher took me to hear it once.

59
00:02:24,560 --> 00:02:27,360
He said Qinqiang is one of the oldest vocal styles.

60
00:02:27,840 --> 00:02:29,320
The resonance structure of the theater

61
00:02:29,320 --> 00:02:31,250
is related to Luban's techniques.

62
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:34,010
Are you here to watch a play?

63
00:02:34,079 --> 00:02:34,880
Unfortunately,

64
00:02:34,880 --> 00:02:35,760
the theater is broken.

65
00:02:35,760 --> 00:02:36,560
It's been closed for half a month.

66
00:02:36,560 --> 00:02:38,079
We are investigating the acoustic field of ancient buildings.

67
00:02:38,079 --> 00:02:39,560
Master Chen here knows woodwork.

68
00:02:39,560 --> 00:02:40,760
Can we go in and take a look?

69
00:02:40,760 --> 00:02:41,490
A carpenter?

70
00:02:41,760 --> 00:02:42,360
Sure.

71
00:02:42,480 --> 00:02:43,800
It's empty anyway.

72
00:02:46,200 --> 00:02:48,480
The resonance cavity under the stage has failed.

73
00:02:48,480 --> 00:02:50,120
When you step on a normal stage,

74
00:02:50,120 --> 00:02:51,200
it sinks a little,

75
00:02:51,640 --> 00:02:53,100
so the sound can be lifted.

76
00:02:53,200 --> 00:02:53,600
Right.

77
00:02:53,680 --> 00:02:56,040
In the past, a voice could reach the last row.

78
00:02:56,040 --> 00:02:58,000
Someone told me to install copper amplifying tubes.

79
00:02:58,000 --> 00:02:59,480
But if the theater really relies on copper tubes,

80
00:02:59,480 --> 00:03:01,210
its original soul will be gone.

81
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:06,280
It can be fixed.

82
00:03:06,680 --> 00:03:07,800
No need to tear down the theater.

83
00:03:07,800 --> 00:03:08,560
Really.

84
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:12,080
Young man, don't fool me.

85
00:03:13,600 --> 00:03:14,400
Lead the way.

86
00:03:14,680 --> 00:03:16,720
The sound is first swallowed by the cracks,

87
00:03:16,720 --> 00:03:18,980
and the loose tenons leak the vibration.

88
00:03:19,040 --> 00:03:20,600
Qinqiang relies on chest resonance,

89
00:03:20,600 --> 00:03:21,600
and so does the theater.

90
00:03:21,600 --> 00:03:22,520
It can be restored.

91
00:03:22,520 --> 00:03:24,079
No need to change materials.

92
00:03:24,079 --> 00:03:25,520
Knock the tenons back,

93
00:03:25,800 --> 00:03:27,240
fill the gaps with tung oil and sawdust,

94
00:03:27,240 --> 00:03:30,840
and add a diagonal brace to each corner of the resonance chamber.

95
00:03:46,360 --> 00:03:48,680
Is the structure stable?

96
00:03:49,120 --> 00:03:50,320
We can test the sound.

97
00:04:03,480 --> 00:04:04,160
Old Wei.

98
00:04:04,280 --> 00:04:05,240
It's ready.

99
00:04:05,480 --> 00:04:06,680
Come up and test it.

100
00:04:07,080 --> 00:04:07,880
Yes.

101
00:04:11,280 --> 00:04:14,840
A lonely soul with nowhere to rely on,

102
00:04:14,880 --> 00:04:19,120
the stars and moon are dim, the wind and dew are cold.

103
00:04:26,120 --> 00:04:27,280
This is the sound.

104
00:04:27,720 --> 00:04:28,440
Ten years.

105
00:04:28,640 --> 00:04:30,120
I haven't heard it so complete.

106
00:04:30,120 --> 00:04:30,880
Master Chen.

107
00:04:30,880 --> 00:04:31,940
How much is the fee?

108
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:32,680
No need.

109
00:04:32,680 --> 00:04:34,280
The tenons and mortises are back in place.

110
00:04:34,280 --> 00:04:35,600
The sound of the theater should also return.

111
00:04:35,600 --> 00:04:37,280
You are not fixing the stage,

112
00:04:37,480 --> 00:04:39,560
but the lives of us old folks.

113
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:42,980
As long as this theater is still here,

114
00:04:43,080 --> 00:04:45,740
you don't need to buy tickets whenever you come.

115
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:53,200
By the way,

116
00:04:53,720 --> 00:04:55,480
the old gentleman you four are asking about,

117
00:04:55,480 --> 00:04:56,640
I should have seen him.

118
00:04:56,640 --> 00:04:59,400
A few years ago, during the months when the museum was renovated,

119
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:01,480
he often came to our theater to listen to operas.

120
00:05:01,480 --> 00:05:03,840
The old gentleman always gave extra tea money,

121
00:05:03,840 --> 00:05:05,370
so I remember him very well.

122
00:05:05,600 --> 00:05:06,600
Director Li said,

123
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,800
the Sushi Ancient Architecture Museum

124
00:05:07,800 --> 00:05:09,200
has not been peaceful these years.

125
00:05:09,200 --> 00:05:11,000
He has a relative who works the night shift there.

126
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:12,600
There are always strange noises on the first basement floor,

127
00:05:12,600 --> 00:05:14,280
and the guards have fallen ill one after another.

128
00:05:14,280 --> 00:05:15,440
On the map of Moyuan,

129
00:05:15,560 --> 00:05:16,890
there is a mark in Sushi.

130
00:05:17,200 --> 00:05:18,720
It happens that the deputy director of the museum

131
00:05:18,720 --> 00:05:19,960
is an old friend of my teacher.

132
00:05:19,960 --> 00:05:21,020
Let's go visit him.

133
00:05:21,400 --> 00:05:22,600
It's related to the Mohist school.

134
00:05:22,600 --> 00:05:24,530
The clue to Master should be there.

135
00:05:30,080 --> 00:05:32,409
You are the friends introduced by Xiao Su.

136
00:05:33,040 --> 00:05:34,120
Hello, Director Li.

137
00:05:34,120 --> 00:05:34,920
Follow me.

138
00:05:41,040 --> 00:05:42,440
I'm on the night shift again tonight,

139
00:05:42,440 --> 00:05:44,120
the third time this month.

140
00:05:44,480 --> 00:05:46,480
They all say there are strange noises in the exhibition hall at night.

141
00:05:46,480 --> 00:05:47,810
Now no one wants to come.

142
00:05:48,520 --> 00:05:51,040
Isn't it just the foundation ruins of the old Mohist residence from the previous dynasty?

143
00:05:51,040 --> 00:05:52,170
What could be there?

144
00:05:57,400 --> 00:05:58,930
Master must have been here.

145
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:12,720
These four pillars are not original to the old Mohist residence.

146
00:06:12,720 --> 00:06:14,680
This is a formation of Yanshi's dark arts,

147
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:16,410
trapping the thing in the well,

148
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:19,660
and also extracting the vitality of the earth vein.

149
00:06:20,280 --> 00:06:21,840
Four Pillars Trapping Dragon Formation.

150
00:06:21,840 --> 00:06:22,640
Yes.

151
00:06:23,120 --> 00:06:25,580
What is sealed is not an ordinary evil thing.

152
00:06:33,159 --> 00:06:36,040
Letting you stay as night repairers,

153
00:06:36,280 --> 00:06:37,740
this is against the rules.

154
00:06:39,040 --> 00:06:40,680
Strange things can no longer be treated as coincidences.

155
00:06:40,680 --> 00:06:42,880
The first basement floor retains the old formation of Yanshi's dark arts.

156
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:44,120
Give us one night.

157
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:45,450
At least we can find out.

158
00:06:46,560 --> 00:06:47,880
One night is enough.

159
00:06:50,480 --> 00:06:52,540
So you are the people of an old friend.

160
00:06:58,120 --> 00:06:58,960
Senior brother.

161
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,560
What are you thinking about?

162
00:07:00,800 --> 00:07:01,930
Thinking of Master.

163
00:07:02,360 --> 00:07:05,440
Those four beads have Yang magic runes left by Master.

164
00:07:05,920 --> 00:07:09,120
They originally blocked the operation of the formation.

165
00:07:09,720 --> 00:07:11,040
But it's been too long.

166
00:07:11,600 --> 00:07:13,160
They have almost completely faded away.

167
00:07:13,160 --> 00:07:15,520
So strange things are happening more and more frequently.

168
00:07:15,520 --> 00:07:19,080
Uncle Xuanchen's whereabouts are related to the Mo family, right?

169
00:07:19,080 --> 00:07:20,340
I was still young then.

170
00:07:20,920 --> 00:07:22,450
He didn't explain clearly.

171
00:07:22,480 --> 00:07:23,720
Then he disappeared.

172
00:07:31,800 --> 00:07:33,159
The defense formation has been set up.

173
00:07:33,159 --> 00:07:34,600
The things in the well can't get out.

174
00:07:34,600 --> 00:07:35,240
Qinghe.

175
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:36,320
After you go down,

176
00:07:36,320 --> 00:07:37,200
be careful.

177
00:07:37,320 --> 00:07:38,600
Pull up the rope.

178
00:07:38,720 --> 00:07:40,250
Prepare to go down the well.

179
00:07:46,600 --> 00:07:47,800
Sprained your ankle?

180
00:07:49,400 --> 00:07:50,120
No.

181
00:07:50,760 --> 00:07:52,220
I just got a little scared.

182
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:54,159
If you hug a little longer,

183
00:07:54,159 --> 00:07:55,020
it will be dawn.

184
00:08:01,520 --> 00:08:02,120
Xiaotang.

185
00:08:02,320 --> 00:08:03,120
Come help.
